rentice she draws a line across the  way and if any of them cross it she will  beat them up  gone makes countless tries but to no  avail canary wonders why he lets himself  get beaten like that  bellum says to canary that he just wants  to see kiluah canary is finally  convinced after hearing gone and as she  pleads him to help kilauea she is  knocked out by killwa's mother who is  watching from the bushes with kaluto she  thinks canaria has insulted the entire  zoldit family kiko then sees gon and  instantly recognizes him as a loomy told  her about him she delivers a message  from kilauea telling them that he can't  see them right now  gon kurapika and leorio tend to an  unconscious canary  meanwhile killua gets whipped by his  older brother miluki he accuses kilauea  of being too arrogant and killua  apologizes for stabbing his brother  during his escape the torture is cut  short when kikayo calls milky's phone  telling him that kilawa's friends are  near the butler's office milikey mocks  killua by asking their mother to drive  them away  killawa pulls one of his chains and  threatens to kill miluki if they even  touch his friends  kikayo introduces herself and kaludo  gonna asks why killua can't see them and  kikkail replies that kilwat entered  solitary confinement on his own will  she suddenly begins talking to herself  in haste and in worry  zeno enters the solitary confinement and  tells kilauea that he can leave he  easily breaks off the chains and tells  milky that he is not sorry but he does  feel bad about stabbing him before  kilauea could leave zeno added that his  father silva wants to see him millikid  feroza fit and accuses zeno of spoiling  kiluah he begins to praise himself and  nag about his latest invention a bomb  carrying mosquito that will explode once  the mosquito bites its target kikau  continues talking and eventually excuses  herself  gon ask her to tell kilauea that they  will stay canary awakens and volunteers  to take them to the but